            0.047,
            0.879
          ],
          "content": "Curiosity | Textbook of Science | Grade 7"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.409,
            0.116,
            0.606,
            0.169
          ],
          "content": "How does heat get transferred in these materials?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.398,
            0.082,
            0.755,
            0.235
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_image_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.241,
            0.882,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": "Let us **perform** an activity to learn why certain materials are good conductors of heat."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.272,
            0.298,
            0.615,
            0.322
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "7.1 Conduction of Heat"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.274,
            0.352,
            0.583,
            0.373
          ],
          "content": "**Activity 7.1: Let us experiment**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.215,
            0.386,
            0.255,
            0.414
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_image_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.387,
            0.884,
            0.423
          ],
          "content": "**Caution** — This activity should be carried out under the supervision of a teacher or an adult."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.077,
            0.432,
            0.434,
            0.642
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.095,
                0.649,
                0.399,
                0.667
              ],
              "content": "Fig. 7.1: Heat transfer in a metal strip"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_image_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.443,
            0.435,
            0.883,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": "Take a strip of a metal, such as aluminium or iron, about 15 cm long."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.444,
            0.478,
            0.884,
            0.553
          ],
          "content": "Attach four pins to the strip with the help of wax such that they are arranged at nearly equal distances (about 2 cm apart), as shown in Fig. 7.1."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.444,
            0.557,
            0.884,
            0.633
          ],
          "content": "Secure the strip to a stand and label the pins as I, II, III, and IV, as shown in Fig. 7.1. (If a stand is not available, place the strip between two bricks for support.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.444,
            0.636,
            0.883,
            0.676
          ],
          "content": "Heat the end of the strip that is away from the stand with a candle or a spirit lamp."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.68,
            0.882,
            0.719
          ],
          "content": "What will happen to the pins? Will they remain attached to the strip or will they fall?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.723,
            0.868,
            0.744
          ],
          "content": "**Predict** the order in which the pins will fall from the strip."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.265,
            0.747,
            0.678,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": "**Record** your observations in Table 7.1."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.248,
            0.774,
            0.879,
            0.917
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_image_17.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.277,
            0.858,
            0.384,
            0.876
          ],
          "content": "**Prediction**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.375,
            0.824,
            0.525,
            0.844
          ],
          "content": "**Pin falling first**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.469,
            0.86,
            0.593,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "**Observation**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.655,
            0.835,
            0.863,
            0.87
          ],
          "continues_prev": true,
          "content": "**Reasons for what you observed**"
